I added `cheapestStart` at the end of `src/tariff.ts`. It quotes each start day from `fromDay` to `toDay` with `quoteHire` and no pets, and keeps the first day with the lowest total. Because a later day must be strictly cheaper to replace it, ties go to the earliest day, and the day is returned as given, not wrapped into the year. I haven't run it. An invalid `nights` makes `quoteHire` throw its usual `RangeError`.
